Article 1 The Shanghai Financial Court shall have jurisdiction over the following first-instance financial civil and commercial cases within the jurisdiction of the Shanghai Municipality that shall be accepted by an Intermediate People's Court:
(1) disputes over securities, futures trading, trust, insurance, negotiable instruments, letters of credit, financial loan contracts, bank cards, financial leasing contracts, entrusted wealth management contracts, pawn and others;
(2) new types of financial civil and commercial disputes such as independent guarantees, factoring, private equity funds, online payment by non-bank payment institutions, online lending, and internet equity crowdfunding;
(3) bankruptcy disputes with a financial institution as the debtor;
(4) cases of judicial review of arbitration over financial civil and commercial disputes;
(5) cases concerning applications for recognition and enforcement of judgments and rulings of foreign courts on financial civil and commercial disputes.
